SUMMARY:Atheist chat at the Whole Foods cafe on Tunnel Road
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Atheists\nPlease visit with us **Sunday August 16** 
 at a **new location** and enjoy chatting with like-minded people. We're me
 eting **once a month on Sunday mornings**. Mark your calendar for this on 
 **August 16\, and then Sept 20 and October 18.**\nIf you *think* you might
  come\, please mark **Attend** below\; that helps us know how many tables 
 to put together.\n\nOur new location is **the cafe upstairs** at **Whole F
 oods on South Tunnel Road.** They have coffee and a lot more. Maybe you ha
 ve shopping you want to do at Whole Foods or one of the other businesses o
 n Tunnel Road.\n\n**We start at 10am and end at noon**\, but you're welcom
 e to arrive or leave according to your own schedule.\n\nIf some folks want
  to have serious conversations about religion and/or atheism\, while other
 s just want to chat about other things\, we'll use two sets of tables.\n\n
 **We hope *you* stop by**. You can also feel free to tell other non-believ
 ers about our meetups - they are welcome too.\n\nIf you have other dates\,
  times\, locations or activities to suggest for the future\, please email 
 them to peterthorwarth@gmail.com Thanks!
